  "host_reconstruction": "f0_hz = 2 ** (baseline_log2 + plain_scale * plain + vib_scale * vibrato); voiced = (vuv > 0.5) & not pau. baseline_log2 = log2 of the note-pitch staircase (Hz) smoothed by a Gaussian of baseline_sigma_sec. Pitch correction (Blaauw stage + asymmetric Tukey stage) applies to plain only.",
